\", \"s27\", \"s34\", \"s35\", \"s36\", \"s43\", \"s44\"],\n          \"entity_scope\": \"user\",\n          \"time_scope\": \"past\",\n          \"parent_versions\": {},\n          \"retract_ids\": [],\n          \"reason\": \"The user explicitly states enjoying creating their own tracks (s14, s15), composing original music (s6, s7, s8, s9), digital remixing (s43, s44), and launching a podcast (s24, s25, s26, s27). They also express a preference for emotional connection over technical production (s12, s13) and describe frustration with collaborative band dynamics (s34, s35, s36). These sources collectively establish a sustained past interest in music creation and podcasting.\"\n        }\n      ],\n      \"unresolved\": []\n    }\n  ]\n}", "response_metadata": {"finish_reason": "stop", "refusal": null, "usage": {"prompt_tokens": 7267, "total_tokens": 7660, "completion_tokens": 393, "prompt_tokens_details": null, "completion_tokens_details": {"reasoning_tokens": 0, "audio_tokens": null, "accepted_prediction_tokens": null, "rejected_prediction_tokens": null}}, "response_id": "chatcmpl-b17961f488a2115f", "protocol": "plain"}, "response_ref": "31833b12253d5425f15014fb0de04b9274f2ee314035a2ee69ba43ed9cbbfbe5", "output_tokens_estimate": 543, "finish_reason": "stop", "refusal": null, "usage": {"prompt_tokens": 7267, "total_tokens": 7660, "completion_tokens": 393, "prompt_tokens_details": null, "completion_tokens_details": {"reasoning_tokens": 0, "audio_tokens": null, "accepted_prediction_tokens": null, "rejected_prediction_tokens": null}}, "response_id": "chatcmpl-b17961f488a2115f", "protocol": "plain", "sequence": 65, "elapsed_seconds": 38.25570631027222}
