constraints and changes using the supplied parent versions and\noriginal quotations. A history summary describes what the sources establish;\nit must not address the user, offer a new recommendation or draft a reply.\nThe original user utterance provides query context. It is not an instruction to\nanswer it at this stage or to retrieve an exact duplicate of what it already says.\nPublic response options are not available here. Do not invent, compare or refer\nto options A/B/C/D. Return exactly the slots object; no final_prediction or\nsemantic_answer fields belong in a history-evidence response.\nKeep each value within its declared type, entity and time scope. Preserve earlier\nand later attitudes, conditions and supporting quotations; a historical dislike\nmust not silently replace a later documented change. Assistant advice alone does\nnot establish an adopted user preference. Do not invent external catalogues,\navailability or past execution of a future suggestion. A partial observation must\ncite its actual clue. Use unresolved only for a specific condition still necessary\nto establish this requested historical value, not hypothetical exhaustive coverage.\nFor one text-summary variable, synthesize compatible query-relevant facts into one\nsufficient source-grounded whole summary; do not report each event as a different\ncomplete value of that variable. Multiple supports must be alternative sufficient\nproofs of the same whole value. Keep partial evidence, negative experiences and\nvalid counters explicit when a complete scoped summary is not established.\nPositive and negative experiences can both support a historical summary. A sourced\ndislike is useful history, not automatically a contradiction observation: that\nstance is reserved for challenging an identified existing fact route. Preserve\nthe difference between past enjoyment, later frustration and their conditions in\nthe value and citations; do not summarize them as an unconditional current interest.\nRe-read any supplied evidence obligations and their original sources explicitly;\ndo not drop a source or contradiction merely because a prior value is available.\nOnly a variable explicitly declaring evidence_semantics=\"personal_history_summary\"\npermits a source-grounded summary_revision. For compatible added history, preserve\nthe old and new facts, negative experiences and time conditions in the new summary;\nexplicitly name the current old summary routes and version as offered by the\nprotocol. Re-read and cite their original sources together with the new evidence.\nThis retires an old summary representation without asserting that its historical\nfacts were false. A genuine factual refutation remains a contradiction with its\nown sources and targets. Never use summary revision to hide or discard a counter,\nchange scope, choose an arbitrary latest value, or revise the terminal response.\nA personal_atomic_fact variable keeps one scoped factual value. Different sources\nmay independently support that same value; separate compatible events are not\nalternative whole values of an atomic fact. This declaration does not permit summary_revision.\n\nThis request is phase=history_evidence. Its ONLY top-level output field is slots. Do not return semantic_answer, final_prediction, audit_verdict, or any other top-level field, even null. Read or summarize the requested scoped historical evidence; do not write a conversational reply or invent candidate responses.\n\nAn explicitly declared personal_history_summary is a revisable representation of\nsourced history. Compatible additional facts do not contradict the older facts.\nOnly summary_revision_contracts authorizes this request to revise such a summary:\nthis permission exists only in phase=history_evidence. Terminal response selection\nand audit forbid summary_revision even for requested historical parent summaries.\nThey may still report genuine sourced counters or conservative partial/unresolved\nissues; the phase restriction never permits discarding contrary evidence.\nreturn a support observation with summary_revision={supersedes_route_ids,\nprevious_version,reason}, using exact offered route IDs and the current version.\nsummary_revision_contracts.required_source_ids covers replacing ALL offered\neligible_route_ids. When selecting only a subset, retain those selected routes'\nsources, their actual-parent source closure and relevant same-variable counters.\nStructured repair feedback gives the exact required set for that draft's targets.\nThis capability is optional, not a requirement to revise an unchanged summary.\nWith no new observation, return observations=[] unless an outstanding review\nrequires its original draft IDs and sources. For such an unchanged draft, the\nsame sourced support with a valid summary_revision is an idempotent recheck: it\nkeeps the existing routes, ancestry and version, and does not assert new evidence.\nRe-read ALL old and new original premises and relevant counterevidence; retain\nthem in the new support's source_ids and preserve their factual content, negative\nexperiences, conditions and temporal qualifications in the revised whole summary.\nsummary_revision_sources in repair feedback names exact source identities for\nthe selected revision targets, not counts. Re-read and retain EVERY\nrequired_source_ids entry in that feedback; new sources cannot\nreplace missing old identities even if the total citation count is unchanged.\nThe complete missing_source_ids list is structured feedback, not permission to\nfill citations automatically. If the originals actually conflict, return a\nsource-grounded counter or partial/unresolved evidence instead of a revision.\nIn failed_batch_reviews this feedback describes the retained original failed\nobservation; repair_scope describes the current attempted correction.\nretract_ids stays empty. This explicitly retires the older representation, not its\nfacts. Never use revision to hide a genuine contradiction, unavailable evidence,\nor a different scope/parent version. Ordinary facts and all terminal/audit variables\ncannot use summary_revision. If a complete compatible account is not supported,\nreturn sourced partial/unresolved instead. Multiple new supports must agree on\none whole value. Existing superseded_by links identify retired representations;\ntheir original evidence remains available. revoked holds actual counterevidence,\nwhich is never erased by a summary revision or ignored through its ancestry.\n\n\nReturn one complete JSON object matching this schema:\n{\"additionalProperties\":false,\"properties\":{\"slots\":{\"items\":{\"additionalProperties\":false,\"oneOf\":[{\"properties\":{\"observations\":{\"items\":{\"allOf\":[{\"if\":{\"properties\":{\"stance\":{\"enum\":[\"support\",\"contradiction\"]}}},\"then\":{\"properties\":{\"entity_scope\":{\"const\":\"user\"},\"time_scope\":{\"const\":\"past\"}}}},{\"if\":{\"required\":[\"summary_revision\"]},\"then\":{\"properties\":{\"retract_ids\":{\"maxItems\":0},\"stance\":{\"const\":\"support\"},\"summary_revision\":{\"properties\":{\"previous_version\":{\"const\":1},\"supersedes_route_ids\":{\"items\":{\"enum\":[\"fact_77fa56e02c3a2be32b81decb\"]}}}}}}}],\"else\":{\"properties\":{\"value\":{\"type\":\"null\"}}},\"if\":{\"properties\":{\"stance\":{\"const\":\"support\"}}},\"properties\":{\"retract_ids\":{\"items\":{\"enum\":[\"fact_77fa56e02c3a2be32b81decb\"]}}},\"then\":{\"properties\":{\"value\":{\"minLength\":1,\"type\":\"string\"}}}}},\"variable\":{\"const\":\"emotional_needs\"}}}],\"properties\":{\"observations\":{\"items\":{\"additionalProperties\":false,\"allOf\":[{\"else\":{\"properties\":{\"retract_ids\":{\"maxItems\":0}}},\"if\":{\"properties\":{\"stance\":{\"const\":\"contradiction\"}}},\"then\":{\"properties\":{\"retract_ids\":{\"minItems\":1}}}}],\"properties\":{\"entity_scope\":{\"type\":\"string\"},\"id\":{\"type\":\"string\"},\"parent_versions\":{\"additionalProperties\":{\"type\":\"integer\"},\"type\":\"object\"},\"reason\":{\"type\":\"string\"},\"retract_ids\":{\"items\":{\"type\":\"string\"},\"type\":\"array\",\"uniqueItems\":true},\"source_ids\":{\"description\":\"Exact visible source_spans[].id aliases, such as s3; never document IDs or invented IDs.\",\"items\":{\"type\":\"string\"},\"type\":\"array\",\"uniqueItems\":true},\"stance\":{\"enum\":[\"support\",\"contradiction\",\"partial\",\"unknown\",\"irrelevant\"],\"type\":\"string\"},\"summary_revision\":{\"additionalProperties\":false,\"properties\":{\"previous_version\":{\"minimum\":0,\"type\":\"integer\"},\"reason\":{\"minLength\":1,\"type\":\"string\"},\"supersedes_route_ids\":{\"items\":{\"type\":\"string\"},\"minItems\":1,\"type\":\"array\",\"uniqueItems\":true}},\"required\":[\"supersedes_route_ids\",\"previous_version\",\"reason\"],\"type\":\"object\"},\"time_scope\":{\"type\":\"string\"},\"value\":{}},\"required\":[\"id\",\"stance\",\"value\",\"source_ids\",\"entity_scope\",\"time_scope\",\"parent_versions\",\"retract_ids\",\"reason\"],\"type\":\"object\"},\"type\":\"array\"},\"unresolved\":{\"items\":{\"type\":\"string\"},\"type\":\"array\"},\"variable\":{\"enum\":[\"emotional_needs\"],\"type\":\"string\"}},\"required\":[\"variable\",\"observations\",\"unresolved\"],\"type\":\"object\"},\"maxItems\":1,\"minItems\":1,\"type\":\"array\"}},\"required\":[\"slots\"],\"type\":\"object\"}"}, {"role": "user", "content": "{\"original_question\":\"I'm exploring new creative outlets and would love some suggestions. Any ideas on activities that can capture emotions and ideas effectively?\",\"task\":{\"question\":\"What emotional or expressive needs has the user mentioned in past conversations?\",\"output_slot\":\"emotional_needs\",\"answer_type\":\"text\",\"inputs\":[],\"execution\":\"retrieval\"},\"grounded_subquestion\":\"What emotional or expressive needs has the user mentioned in past conversations?\",\"request_context\":{\"query_identity\":\"e50045898bb26f782a163e9359f420c05b7fb2b571788b9b4418e149b15478d7\",\"algorithm_version\":\"dagbt_residual_memory_v2\",\"program_identity\":\"c2c3916be3cc29c1b2068571a57e2fdc58242d14b5c6a492d347510ed4146029\",\"initial_dag_identity\":\"fa7136cc14629a0574754851f239d4bd5019efad548c91773407708bede646ce\"},\"variables\":{\"emotional_needs\":{\"type\":\"text\",\"demand\":\"emotional_needs\",\"open\":true,\"evidence_semantics\":\"personal_history_summary\",\"scope\":{\"entity_scope\":\"user\",\"time_scope\":\"past\"}}},\"requested_slots\":[\"emotional_needs\"],\"requested_scopes\":{\"emotional_needs\":{\"entity_scope\":\"user\",\"time_scope\":\"past\"}},\"output_contract\":{\"mode\":\"semantic\",\"result_type\":\"text\",\"entity_scope\":\"user\",\"time_scope\":\"current\",\"explanation\":\"semantic\"},\"program_revision\":0,\"rule_binding\":null,\"supported_parents\":{},\"known_observations\":[{\"id\":\"fact_77fa56e02c3a2be32b81decb\",\"stance\":\"support\",\"value\":\"The user has expressed a need to capture and express emotions and ideas that words alone cannot convey, particularly through music creation. They value deep emotional connection, personal expression, autonomy in creative endeavors, and sharing experiences to inspire others and clarify their own perspective. They have also expressed a need to avoid technical or collaborative environments that feel stifling or disconnected from their artistic essence.\",\"source_ids\":[\"s3\",\"s4\",\"s43\",\"s36\",\"s15\",\"s27\",\"s25\",\"s34\",\"s16\",\"s26\",\"s24\",\"s44\",\"s12\",\"s35\",\"s14\",\"s13\"],\"entity_scope\":\"user\",\"time_scope\":\"past\",\"parent_versions\":{},\"retract_ids\":[],\"reason\":\"The user consistently describes music creation as an outlet for emotions and ideas that words fail to capture (s3, s15), values deep emotional connection over technical dissection (s12, s13), finds joy and satisfaction in creating personal tracks (s14, s15), and sees each track as a piece of identity (s16). They launched a podcast to share experiences and inspire others (s24, s25), and found that articulating thoughts clarified their perspective (s26, s27). They felt stifled in a collaborative band setting and sought autonomy (s34, s35, s36). They also recall excitement and creativity from early music production (s43, s44).\",\"variable\":\"emotional_needs\",\"revoked\":[],\"semantic_status\":\"model_judgment\"}],\"source_spans\":[[\"s3\",\"d1\",105,478,\"User: I left feeling unsatisfied, as though the film skimmed over the intricacies that make music a universal language. It was almost as if they focused too much on celebrity interviews and not enough on the artistic process itself. I found myself reflecting on how music has the power to unite diverse cultures and express emotions that words alone often fail to capture. \",\"user\",[43]],[\"s4\",\"d1\",478,845,\"The disappointment lingered as I thought about the many documentaries that delve into the creative journeys of musicians, revealing not just their triumphs but also their struggles and failures. It made me realize that true connection with music often comes from a deeper engagement, one that can be achieved through personal creation rather than passive consumption.\",\"user\",[43]],[\"s12\",\"d2\",105,430,\"User: I explored audio production techniques, but it just didn’t resonate with me, and I found myself tangled in technical details rather than embracing the creativity. I realized that while understanding the mechanics of sound is important, my true passion seems to lie more in experiencing music rather than dissecting it. \",\"user\",[40,41]],[\"s13\",\"d2\",430,749,\"Despite my attempts to immerse myself in the production process, I came to feel it was more of a chore and less of the rewarding experience I had initially anticipated. I think I am more drawn to the emotional aspects of music, like the storytelling elements in lyrics or the feelings evoked by melodies and harmonies. \",\"user\",[40,41]],[\"s14\",\"d2\",749,1006,\"Perhaps, I should focus my energy on areas that allow me to connect with music on a more emotional level.\\n\\nUser: It genuinely feels much better to focus on what truly inspires me, such as creating my own tracks, which bring me immense joy and satisfaction. \",\"user\",[40,41]],[\"s15\",\"d2\",1006,1339,\"This process of creation allows me to express emotions and ideas that words sometimes fail to capture, acting as an outlet for my inner thoughts and feelings. Additionally, I find that crafting my own music provides me with a sense of accomplishment and personal growth, which is invaluable in a world often filled with uncertainty. \",\"user\",[40,41]],[\"s16\",\"d2\",1339,1686,\"Music has a way of resonating with my soul, and every track I create becomes a piece of my identity and a reflection of my experiences. In contrast, when I watched a music documentary, it felt like something was missing, as it didn’t engage me in the way I had hoped, failing to evoke that same deep connection I feel when I compose my own pieces.\",\"user\",[40,41]],[\"s24\",\"d3\",105,447,\"User: Yes! I launched a podcast discussing the fusion of traditional and electronic music. This platform has allowed me to reach a wider audience and share my experiences authentically. By interviewing artists and enthusiasts, I can dive deep into their creative processes and discover how they incorporate various elements into their music. \",\"user\",[58,59]],[\"s25\",\"d3\",447,817,\"The feedback I’ve received has been overwhelmingly positive, with listeners appreciating the insights and stories shared. I also love being able to explore not just the music itself, but the cultural contexts that shape these genres and influence artists worldwide.\\n\\nUser: I realized that sharing my experiences could inspire others and even reignite my own creativity. \",\"user\",[58,59]],[\"s26\",\"d3\",817,1128,\"The process of putting my thoughts into words has helped clarify my own perspective. It’s surprising how reflecting on past experiences can lead to deeper insights about one’s journey. Additionally, I’ve noticed that when I articulate my thoughts, it motivates me to think critically about my creative process. \",\"user\",[58,59]],[\"s27\",\"d3\",1128,1266,\"This paradigm shift has not only invigorated my passion for music but also allowed me to connect with others who share similar sentiments.\",\"user\",[58,59]],[\"s34\",\"d4\",107,356,\"User: After several disagreements over the artistic direction, I felt stifled, which really discouraged me from that collaborative process. It was as if the creative vision I had in mind was at odds with the direction my bandmates wanted to pursue. \",\"user\",[159]],[\"s35\",\"d4\",356,713,\"I remember those discussions often being emotionally charged, where opinions clashed and passion ran high, but ultimately, it was clear that I couldn't contribute to something that did not resonate with my artistic essence. Feeling restricted in that environment made me question not just my contributions, but also my abilities and instincts as an artist. \",\"user\",[159]],[\"s36\",\"d4\",713,896,\"This inner turmoil prompted a desire for more autonomy over my own creative endeavors, leading to a pivotal decision to explore my artistry in a more personal and independent setting.\",\"user\",[159]],[\"s43\",\"d5\",103,370,\"User: That was back in 2010. I remember feeling really excited about the whole process. It was such a wave of creativity! I still think about those late nights spent tweaking sounds and layering beats, capturing the essence of what I wanted to express through music. \",\"user\",[3]],[\"s44\",\"d5\",370,611,\"The thrill of sharing those creations with others is something I cherish deeply, as it fostered a sense of community among my friends. Looking back, it feels like a pivotal moment that sparked my passion for music production and digital art.\",\"user\",[3]],[\"s49\",\"d6\",0,99,\"Conversation message indices 24–25 (zero-based chronological observation order; not calendar time)\\n\",\"unknown\",[]],[\"s50\",\"d6\",99,105,\"User:\\n\",\"unknown\",[]],[\"s51\",\"d6\",105,482,\"User: I just lost interest halfway through and felt it was taking away the joy I find in music. There was a time when the thrill of discovering new melodies brought so much happiness, but diving too deep into the technical aspects became more of a chore. It’s curious how something that once brought joy can evolve into a source of stress when we start dissecting it too much. \",\"user\",[24]],[\"s52\",\"d6\",482,767,\"I remember the initial excitement of exploring different genres, each bringing a fresh perspective, but I struggled with the framework of music theory. Ultimately, I recognized that the essence of my love for music lay in its emotional connection rather than its analytical components.\",\"user\",[24]],[\"s53\",\"d6\",767,780,\"\\n\\nAssistant:\\n\",\"unknown\",[]],[\"s54\",\"d6\",780,1161,\"Assistant: That’s a great insight! It’s important to focus on what you love. Music is such a personal journey, and it should evoke joy rather than feelings of obligation or frustration. Understanding the theory can certainly enhance one’s appreciation, but if it detracts from the experience, it’s wise to step back. Have you tried any other forms of music exploration since then? \",\"assistant\",[25]],[\"s55\",\"d6\",1161,1499,\"There are so many avenues to experience music, whether it's attending live performances, discovering underground artists, or even engaging in creative collaborations. Each of these can rekindle your passion and allow for a fresh appreciation of the art form, helping you reconnect with what initially drew you to music in the first place.\",\"assistant\",[25]],[\"s56\",\"d7\",0,101,\"Conversation message indices 118–119 (zero-based chronological observation order; not calendar time)\\n\",\"unknown\",[]],[\"s57\",\"d7\",101,107,\"User:\\n\",\"unknown\",[]],[\"s58\",\"d7\",107,454,\"User: I wrote a new blog post reflecting on these experiences. In this post, I aimed to unpack the various feelings that emerged during my recent dating adventures, such as joy, confusion, and even frustration at times. It’s fascinating how writing helps to clarify my thoughts, transforming chaotic emotions into coherent narratives on the page. \",\"user\",[118]],[\"s59\",\"d7\",454,767,\"I often find that the simple act of putting pen to paper—or fingers to keyboard—allows me to examine events from multiple angles. My reflections serve not only as a way to process what has happened in my personal life but also as an opportunity to connect with others who might be experiencing similar situations.\",\"user\",[118]],[\"s60\",\"d7\",767,780,\"\\n\\nAssistant:\\n\",\"unknown\",[]],[\"s61\",\"d7\",780,1152,\"Assistant: Writing can be therapeutic! It serves not only as a tool for self-exploration but also as a means of creating a sense of community among those who read your experiences and relate to them. The act of sharing one's journey can inspire and resonate deeply with readers, potentially sparking their own reflections. What specific topics did you cover in your post? \",\"assistant\",[119]],[\"s62\",\"d7\",1152,1540,\"Did you delve into the unexpected twists that come with dating, such as the exhilaration of first dates or the challenges of navigating relationships in a digital age? Additionally, it's interesting to think about how sharing these stories can also foster discussions about personal growth, the nature of love, and the lessons learned from both successes and setbacks in the dating world.\",\"assistant\",[119]],[\"s83\",\"d8\",0,101,\"Conversation message indices 107–108 (zero-based chronological observation order; not calendar time)\\n\",\"unknown\",[]],[\"s84\",\"d8\",101,107,\"User:\\n\",\"unknown\",[]],[\"s85\",\"d8\",107,341,\"User: It’s become clear to me that I need to focus on what truly inspires me and aligns more with my interests, especially recognizing how vital it is to engage with topics and activities that evoke a sense of passion and enthusiasm. \",\"user\",[107]],[\"s86\",\"d8\",341,694,\"I have realized that my time and energy are precious commodities, and they should be spent on pursuits that not only enrich my knowledge but also bring me a profound sense of fulfillment. Diving deeper into interests that resonate with my core values feels necessary, rather than stretching myself thin over activities that don't spark joy or interest. \",\"user\",[107]],[\"s87\",\"d8\",694,951,\"This realization is quite liberating, as I can see a path ahead that is clearer and more authentic to who I truly am. It makes me think about how we all deserve to chase our passions instead of conforming to what society or external pressures might dictate.\",\"user\",[107]],[\"s88\",\"d8\",951,964,\"\\n\\nAssistant:\\n\",\"unknown\",[]],[\"s89\",\"d8\",964,1189,\"Assistant: It's truly commendable that you've taken this step back to reassess your priorities and focus on your authentic interests, as this kind of self-reflection is often the catalyst for meaningful change in one's life. \",\"assistant\",[108]],[\"s90\",\"d8\",1189,1550,\"When you align your pursuits with what inspires you, not only are you more likely to excel, but you also cultivate a sense of joy and enthusiasm that can be contagious to those around you. It’s fascinating to note how our passions can evolve over time, and sometimes what initially drew us in might not be the same as we uncover deeper layers of our interests. \",\"assistant\",[108]],[\"s91\",\"d8\",1550,1754,\"In choosing to prioritize personal inspiration, you're setting a precedent for a fulfilling journey that could lead to immense personal growth, satisfaction, and a greater connection with your true self. \",\"assistant\",[108]],[\"s92\",\"d8\",1754,2018,\"Take pride in this decision you’re making, as it reflects a deeper understanding of what you truly want out of your experiences and aspirations, and ultimately, such clarity can pave the way for incredible opportunities in both your personal and professional life.\",\"assistant\",[108]],[\"s114\",\"d9\",0,101,\"Conversation message indices 163–164 (zero-based chronological observation order; not calendar time)\\n\",\"unknown\",[]],[\"s115\",\"d9\",101,107,\"User:\\n\",\"unknown\",[]],[\"s116\",\"d9\",107,484,\"User: This has been great for my personal projects, allowing me to really connect with my roots as I create music. By diving into my heritage, I’ve been able to explore different musical styles that are unique to my background, which has been an incredible journey of self-discovery. I find that these sounds resonate with me on a level that feels both familiar and evocative. \",\"user\",[163]],[\"s117\",\"d9\",484,749,\"It feels empowering to express my identity through music, channeling my personal experiences and family history into my compositions. Each note and rhythm becomes a tribute to the cultures that have shaped me, allowing me to convey stories that matter deeply to me.\",\"user\",[163]],[\"s118\",\"d9\",749,762,\"\\n\\nAssistant:\\n\",\"unknown\",[]],[\"s119\",\"d9\",762,1136,\"Assistant: That's a fantastic approach to integrate your culture into your music. When you incorporate traditional elements, you not only honor your heritage but also make a significant contribution to contemporary music as a whole. It might be worthwhile to consider how your unique musical perspective can inspire others who are also on a journey of cultural exploration. \",\"assistant\",[164]],[\"s120\",\"d9\",1136,1386,\"Have you thought about sharing your work more publicly? For instance, setting up an online platform could broaden your audience, and it might provide an opportunity for meaningful engagement with listeners who share similar backgrounds or interests. \",\"assistant\",[164]],[\"s121\",\"d9\",1386,1585,\"You could also explore partnerships with community organizations to enhance visibility and create a supportive network around your music, which could lead to exciting collaborations and new projects.\",\"assistant\",[164]],[\"s122\",\"d10\",0,101,\"Conversation message indices 168–169 (zero-based chronological observation order; not calendar time)\\n\",\"unknown\",[]],[\"s123\",\"d10\",101,107,\"User:\\n\",\"unknown\",[]],[\"s124\",\"d10\",107,504,\"User: I found that my reviews were often criticized for not being objective, which made me less engaged in the process. It felt like I was constantly under the microscope, where every word I wrote was scrutinized by people who often missed the nuance of my opinion. This external pressure led me to second-guess not only my thoughts but also my emotional connection to the music I was discussing. \",\"user\",[168]],[\"s125\",\"d10\",504,830,\"In the end, I realized that the joy I once found in sharing my perspective on albums was overshadowed by the fear of backlash, and that’s a heavy burden for anyone. It became clearer to me that my passion for music needed to be expressed in a more personal, less public way, which is something I’m finally starting to embrace.\",\"user\",[168]],[\"s126\",\"d10\",830,843,\"\\n\\nAssistant:\\n\",\"unknown\",[]],[\"s127\",\"d10\",843,1092,\"Assistant: That’s understandable. Focusing on your artistic expression is more important than fitting into external expectations. Art and music should ultimately be about how they resonate with you and the experiences you wish to share with others. \",\"assistant\",[169]],[\"s128\",\"d10\",1092,1312,\"It’s fascinating how different forms of expression can sometimes become shackled by the very audience they aim to reach, leading to a disconnect that stifles creativity. What about music theory? Have you revisited that? \",\"assistant\",[169]],[\"s129\",\"d10\",1312,1578,\"Diving into the intricacies of music theory can be a great way to reconnect with your love for music without the external pressures, allowing you to explore harmonies, rhythms, and even the cultural context that often informs those Pacific Island texts and rhythms. \",\"assistant\",[169]],[\"s130\",\"d10\",1578,1731,\"It can serve as a method of grounding your creativity, giving you new tools to articulate your feelings and thoughts about music in a more enriching way.\",\"assistant\",[169]],[\"s131\",\"d11\",0,101,\"Conversation message indices 130–131 (zero-based chronological observation order; not calendar time)\\n\",\"unknown\",[]],[\"s132\",\"d11\",101,107,\"User:\\n\",\"unknown\",[]],[\"s133\",\"d11\",107,444,\"User: Well, I created a vision board focused on my relationship goals. It’s an exciting step for me as I believe that envisioning my desires can transform them into reality. The process of crafting the board allowed me to think deeply about what I truly value in relationships, making me reflect on the qualities I cherish in a partner. \",\"user\",[130]],[\"s134\",\"d11\",444,738,\"I carefully selected images, quotes, and symbols that resonate with my aspirations and desires, creating a visual representation that inspires me every day. Overall, the experience was enriching and motivating, helping me to clarify my intentions and goals in the realm of personal connections.\",\"user\",[130]],[\"s135\",\"d11\",738,751,\"\\n\\nAssistant:\\n\",\"unknown\",[]],[\"s136\",\"d11\",751,1011,\"Assistant: Visualizing your goals is powerful! It taps into the profound psychological principle that when we see our aims laid out before us, it not only boosts our motivation, but it also enhances our focus on taking actionable steps towards achieving them. \",\"assistant\",[131]],[\"s137\",\"d11\",1011,1321,\"Furthermore, having visual reminders can act as constant motivators, keeping you aligned with your intentions even amidst life's distractions and challenges. I would love to hear more about the specific targets you've set on your vision board, as discussing these can further solidify your commitment to them. \",\"assistant\",[131]],[\"s138\",\"d11\",1321,1485,\"Each detail can play a significant role in shaping your journey, so knowing how you’ve articulated your dreams can truly provide insight into your pathway forward. \",\"assistant\",[131]],[\"s139\",\"d11\",1485,1726,\"Additionally, it might be intriguing to consider how these goals integrate with your life values, and how aligning your actions with your aspirations can lead to fulfilling relationships that are grounded in mutual respect and understanding.\",\"assistant\",[131]],[\"s140\",\"d12\",0,101,\"Conversation message indices 105–106 (zero-based chronological observation order; not calendar time)\\n\",\"unknown\",[]],[\"s141\",\"d12\",101,107,\"User:\\n\",\"unknown\",[]],[\"s142\",\"d12\",107,396,\"User: However, I dropped out of the audio production course after the first week, feeling overwhelmed by the complexity of the material. It was a tough decision because I really wanted to dive deeper into that realm of knowledge but the sheer volume of information presented was daunting. \",\"user\",[105]],[\"s143\",\"d12\",396,649,\"I keep reflecting on whether I could have approached it differently or managed my time better throughout those early days in the course. There’s a part of me that fears missing out on valuable skills that are essential for pursuing my passion in music. \",\"user\",[105]],[\"s144\",\"d12\",649,816,\"I’ve been thinking about other ways to learn audio production that might feel less intense and more manageable, perhaps through self-study or online resources instead.\",\"user\",[105]],[\"s145\",\"d12\",816,829,\"\\n\\nAssistant:\\n\",\"unknown\",[]],[\"s146\",\"d12\",829,1041,\"Assistant: It's completely understandable to feel overwhelmed, especially in a field as intricate as audio production, where the technical aspects can sometimes feel like speaking an entirely different language. \",\"assistant\",[106]],[\"s147\",\"d12\",1041,1303,\"Dropping out after just one week is certainly not a reflection of your passion; rather, it reflects your self-awareness and ability to recognize when something isn’t suiting you at that moment. This can often be a crucial step in defining your learning journey. \",\"assistant\",[106]],[\"s148\",\"d12\",1303,1530,\"Pursuing knowledge through different means, such as self-study or even seeking mentorship from seasoned professionals in a more relaxed setting, can provide you with a tailored experience that better suits your learning style. \",\"assistant\",[106]],[\"s149\",\"d12\",1530,1720,\"It’s commendable that you’re considering alternatives, and by doing so, you’re taking proactive steps to ensure that your education aligns with your personal growth and creative aspirations.\",\"assistant\",[106]]],\"required_scope\":{\"entity_scope\":\"user\",\"time_scope\":\"past\"},\"rules_completion_required\":false,\"supported_task_outputs\":{},\"personal_response_selection\":true,\"phase\":\"history_evidence\",\"summary_revision_contracts\":{\"emotional_needs\":{\"previous_version\":1,\"eligible_route_ids\":[\"fact_77fa56e02c3a2be32b81decb\"],\"required_source_ids\":[\"s3\",\"s4\",\"s43\",\"s36\",\"s15\",\"s27\",\"s25\",\"s34\",\"s16\",\"s26\",\"s24\",\"s44\",\"s12\",\"s35\",\"s14\",\"s13\"]}},\"repair_scope\":{\"failed\":[{\"variable\":\"emotional_needs\",\"id\":\"fact_77fa56e02c3a2be32b81decb\",\"feedback\":\"citation_capacity: mandatory semantic_compose at response exceeds the actual context including repair reserve. Recheck this same draft; cite the shortest sufficient original spans, not the whole reading window. Keep every necessary premise \",\"observation\":{\"id\":\"fact_77fa56e02c3a2be32b81decb\",\"stance\":\"support\",\"value\":\"The user has expressed a need to capture and express emotions and ideas that words alone cannot convey, particularly through music creation. They value deep emotional connection, personal expression, autonomy in creative endeavors, and sharing experiences to inspire others and clarify their own perspective. They have also expressed a need to avoid technical or collaborati